@startuml
[*] --> unvalidated

unvalidated --> unsinnig : structural validation fail [S_i = 0]
unvalidated --> sinnlos : tautology or contradiction
unvalidated --> sinnvoll_true : evaluate proposition [S_i = 1 and V_i = 1]
unvalidated --> sinnvoll_false : evaluate proposition [S_i = 1 and V_i = 0]
@enduml